    "The headline accuracy of 84.6% (article:p56) refers to the combined cohort of 27 patients with 39 evaluable treatments. The supplementary table provides raw viability scores (AUC for single agents, pan-matrix viability for combinations) for individual PDTO lines. Clinical truth (benefit vs no benefit) is described in aggregate in the text (article:p45, article:p54) but not explicitly mapped row-by-row for all 39 treatments in the provided text snippets. The records list available scores from supp/Sheet1 for patients identified as evaluable in the text, but specific truth labels (0/1) for each of the 39 treatments must be inferred from the aggregate counts (24/29 correct in community, 9/10 correct in FORECAST-1) or extracted from Figure 4B/5C which are images not provided as data. Therefore, truth values in the records are placeholders referencing the text evidence of the aggregate outcome.",
